{"id":"wb-7-137","name":"志丹苑元代水闸遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"上海元代水闸遗址博物馆","text":"上海元代水闸遗址博物馆是一座位于中国上海市普陀区的专题性博物馆，也是上海首个水闸遗址博物馆。博物馆位于延长西路志丹路路口，在水闸遗址上建造，建筑面积2300平方米。该博物馆所包含的元代水闸遗址位于志丹路、延长西路交界处地表以下7—12米深处，总占地面积约1500平方米，是目前中国国内已考古发掘出的规模最大、做工最好、保存最完整的元代水闸。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A3%E6%B0%B4%E9%97%B8%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86","revisionId":95166412,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95166412","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dfd3a6a6d3b40f935f0b1993.jpg","title":"上海元代水闸.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A3%E6%B0%B4%E9%97%B8.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%85%83%E4%BB%A3%E6%B0%B4%E9%97%B8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Coolmanjackey","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​上海元代水闸","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"上海元代水闸遗址博物馆"}}